&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be determined, organized and methodical, with excellent judgement and a genuine passion for helping creators succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can work from San Francisco, CA; Irvine, CA; Los Angeles, CA; Seattle, CA; New York, NY.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review daily reports highlighting new creators who are gaining traction on Twitch and identify those with the greatest long-term potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct research to verify creator authenticity, evaluate audience quality and determine whether creators meet Twitch&#39;s partnership and recruitment criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reach out to promising organic creators, build relationships, and guide them through the next stage of their growth on Twitch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Search across social platforms and creator communities to identify emerging talent who could thrive on Twitch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiate thoughtful cold outreach and persuade creators to see Twitch as an exciting next step in their careers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide creators through onboarding, ensuring they are set up for success from their first stream onward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay closely connected to creator trends, new platforms and cultural moments to continually improve how Twitch identifies and develops creator talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Strategic Partner Managers to support creator growth, troubleshoot challenges and transition creators into long-term account management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
