&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Twitch is the world&#39;s biggest live streaming service, with global communities built around gaming, entertainment, music, sports, cooking, and more. It is where thousands of communities come together for whatever, every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re about community, inside and out. You&#39;ll find coworkers who are eager to team up, collaborate, and smash (or elegantly solve) problems together. We&#39;re on a quest to empower live communities, so if this sounds good to you, see what we&#39;re up to on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/2320329/admin/dashboard/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/Twitch&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, and discover the projects we&#39;re solving on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.twitch.tv/en/&quot;&gt;Blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Program Manager, you will serve as an individual contributor on the PEP team, reporting to the Head of People Engagement &amp;amp; Performance. You&#39;ll manage a series of programs centered around how employees connect to Twitch (to the company, to each other, and to the product)&amp;nbsp; across their entire lifecycle.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end program management of the Engagement portfolio, including the New Employee Experience, Tenure Recognition, the Mentorship Program, and Twitch Clubs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project manage Twitch&#39;s company-wide listening mechanism, the annual Purple Pulse Engagement Survey, end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep a distributed workforce informed and aligned by producing the bi-weekly Staff Brief and Manager Monthly newsletters, and maintaining Twitch&#39;s Role Guideline Repository on ServiceNow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships with our swag vendors end to end, from procurement through ongoing partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modernize the portfolio, evolving the new employee experience, recognition, and mentorship programs and scaling delivery through AI-enabled automation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success metrics, drive timely decisions, and proactively identify and mitigate risks to keep every program on track and continuously improving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;4+ years in program management, employee engagement, communications, L&amp;amp;D, or a related people/HR function.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent professional experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;A track record managing concurrent programs with distinct audiences and competing timelines while proactively clearing blockers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Experience owning programs end to end, from planning and stakeholder alignment through delivery and measurement, where the solution may not be fully defined.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Strong written, visual, and verbal communication skills, with the ability to turn requirements into clear documentation, compelling content, and regular stakeholder updates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with vendor management, including procurement and contracting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort using data to measure program effectiveness and inform improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Experience using AI to enhance your workflow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with survey platforms (e.g., Peakon/Workday), ServiceNow content management, or learning/mentorship systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Experience delivering hybrid and in-person employee experiences at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;You watch, stream, or are genuinely curious about Twitch, gaming, or live entertainment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
