&lt;li&gt;Partner across Security, Identity, Privacy, and Infrastructure on Twitch-wide initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Drive operational excellence: observability, reliability, and operational readiness for critical systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the engineering bar through design reviews, code reviews, clear technical decision-making and validation including AI-assisted output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in, retrospectives, and technical discussions, influencing decisions through technical leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
