&lt;p&gt;As a key member of the engineering team, you will report to the Senior Engineering Manager of Payments team and have the opportunity to build and scale solutions that affect millions of users and broadcasters. &amp;nbsp;You will take high ownership of your services - architecting, building and operating them. &amp;nbsp;You will partner with other engineers, product managers, designers and data specialists to deliver solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
